## Task 042 CI / release-gate artifacts
# deploy/verify.sh writes its machine-readable result here on every run. The
# artifacts are evidence for a specific rollout, not source: a committed one
# would be a file that is wrong the moment anything is redeployed.
deploy/.artifacts/
# Local scratch for the throwaway API stand-in used to exercise verify.sh's
# post-deploy branches. See docs/ci-branch-protection.md §9.
.verify-stub/

