tests/cross-layer/.artifacts/
## Task 046 E2E harness
# `e2e/playwright.config.ts` writes its own output directory, so it is ignored
# separately from the rig's rather than reusing the same entry - a shared entry
# would have meant editing 040A's line to cover a directory that did not exist
# when it was written.
e2e/.artifacts/
test-results/
playwright-report/
# The rig's build profile holds public VITE_* values only and is committed on
# purpose: the frontend origin, the API base URL and the CSP allow-list are a
# single contract, and a silently untracked file breaks it. Negated because the
# blanket `.env.*` rule above exists to keep real secrets out of the repo.
!frontend/.env.cross-layer

# Task 043. The allowlist EXAMPLE, and it was never tracked — the blanket
# `.env.*` rule swallowed it, so a fresh clone had no `.env.example` and both
# `docs/ci.md` step 7 (`cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env`) and
# `Dockerfile.frontend`'s fallback were copying a file that did not exist. On a
# developer's machine it was present and untracked, so nothing noticed.
#
# The file holds no secret: it is generated from DEPLOY_CONFIG_ALLOWLIST
# (frontend/src/config/env.ts) and `scripts/vite-env-audit.sh` refuses any key or
# value on that list which is secret-shaped. That is the point of tracking it —
# it is the allowlist's documentation, and documentation nobody can read in a
# clone is not documentation.
!frontend/.env.example

# The per-environment file `deploy/config-inject.sh` GENERATES. Stays ignored, and
# the negation above is deliberately narrow: this is the one file that must not
# be committed, because it is whatever origin someone was last building against.

# The version document `deploy/config-inject.sh` GENERATES, and the Dockerfile
# copies into `frontend/dist/`. Ignored for the same reason and with the same
# consequence: it records a commit sha and an origin from one developer's machine,
# and a committed one would be served to every user who loads the app. Staged as
# a sibling of `.env.production` rather than inside `dist/` because `vite build`
# empties `outDir` - see the header of deploy/config-inject.sh.
frontend/version.json
